It would be more appropriate for the student to
incorporate the policy within a report describing
different approaches to equal opportunities.

Reliable

A reliable method of assessment will produce
consistent assessment results for different teachers
assessing on each occasion. Internal moderators must
make sure that all teachers’ assessment decisions are
consistent.

