4658: earlier series but the exam must be taken in the final series.
4659: 
4660: If a student takes the exam in a series before their work for NEA units are submitted, this is considered as a ‘practise’
4661: attempt and will not contribute to their final qualification grade. The student must take their exam again in their
4662: final assessment series and that exam result will be used towards the student’s final qualification grade.
